-- COMPLEX UNKNOT — coiled circle (topologically trivial)
-- A circle of radius 8 with 4 helical coils of radius 3
-- This is an UNKNOT but has crossings in every orthographic projection
-- COUNTEREXAMPLE: unknotted curve with no clean projection
